folders as patch 3's bootstrap.sh does, then synced and indexed.
just check in dotfiles/notmuch passes every check:

    ok mbsync logs in to lab-mail and lists INBOX Next Later Archive
    ok a dry run of mbsync lab-mail succeeds
    ok the post-new hook is installed
    ok msmtp reaches lab-mail
